# AEGIS ImageLab protection allowlist.
#
# The exact set of functions annotated "aegis.protect" in src/kernels.cpp.
# These are C-linkage (unmangled) symbols with scalar-integer-only signatures,
# as required by the LLVM Shield in protectors/llvm.
#
# Contract, checked by the imagelab.annotations CTest:
#   this list == functions selected by "aegis.protect" in the kernels IR.
# A protector that selects by name instead of by annotation should read
# this file. Format: one symbol per line; '#' starts a comment.
imagelab_tone_map_pixel
imagelab_color_adjust_pixel
imagelab_enhance_pixel
